WEBVTT

00:07:32.531 --> 00:08:10.090
★Adam wanted to buy a new backpack for school. At first, he thought he would buy one online because there are many websites that sell backpacks at low prices. However, he was not sure if the backpack he wanted would be big enough for his books. In the end, he bought a backpack at a store near his home. It was a little more expensive, but it was the right size for him.
☆☆Question: Why did Adam buy a backpack at a store instead of online?
